飞机可能迅速失去速度和高度;
在中等到严重的颠簸情况下，飞行员很难控制飞机。
严重颠簸甚至可能造成飞机结构损坏和乘客受伤。

cards.referenceText:
Keeping control of the aircraft is the most important thing in this situation;
Then, we should report the situation to ATC.
Besides, we will make a PA to inform the cabin crew and passengers to fasten their seat belts.

There are some reasons for runway incursion.
Bad weather such as heavy fog, low visibility may cause runway incursion;
Misunderstanding between pilots and controllers may cause runway incursion;
Pilots’ lack of situation awareness;
Poor airport management, for example, the ground vehicle enters the runway without ATC clearance, may cause runway incursion.

In this situation, first we will follow SOP to do checklist;
Then we will call ATC, report our situation and request radar vectors;
If necessary, we will try to land as soon as possible.

If the air conditioning system fails during takeoff, we will return to land.
Because if the air conditioning system fails, the temperature will be too high or too low;
And the pressurization system may be out of work, it may affect flight safety.
